{"type":"message","id":"b10bea0b","parentId":"aa9251a4","timestamp":"2026-04-08T22:34:30.602Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[cron:0f2e06c5-425c-40b2-845b-135e47277fe1 github-repo-daily-briefing] 매일 09:00 KST 기준으로 GitHub 인기 레포 브리핑을 생성해 Sam에게 한국어로 전달하세요. 반드시 GitHub API(gh api 또는 공식 REST)로 실제 데이터를 조회하세요. 출력 형식: (1) 최근 인기 Top 5(최근 7일 생성 + stars 기준), (2) 누적 스타 상위 Top 5(archived 제외, 가능하면 최근 활동 있는 레포 우선), (3) 각 레포 핵심 설명 1~2문장(무엇/왜 중요한지), (4) OpenClaw 또는 Claude Code에 바로 적용 가능한 아이디어 3~5개(자동화/보안/개발생산성 관점), (5) 오늘 바로 실행할 액션 3개. 중복 레포는 한 번만 노출하고 전체 2500자 이내로 간결하게 작성하세요.\nCurrent time: Thursday, April 9th, 2026 — 7:34 AM (Asia/Seoul) / 2026-04-08 22:34 UTC\n\nReturn your summary as plain text; it will be delivered automatically. If the task explicitly calls for messaging a specific external recipient, note who/where it should go instead of sending it yourself."}],"timestamp":1775687670596}}
{"type":"message","id":"e8f36b39","parentId":"b10bea0b","timestamp":"2026-04-08T22:34:41.114Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The cron job `github-repo-daily-briefing` (id: 0f2e06c5-425c-40b2-845b-135e47277fe1) is asking me to generate a GitHub trending repositories briefing in Korean, delivered at 09:00 KST daily. The briefing should:\n\n1. Use GitHub API (gh api or official REST) to fetch real data\n2. Output format:\n   - (1) Recent popular Top 5 (created in last 7 days + sorted by stars)\n   - (2) All-time top stars Top 5 (exclude archived, prioritize repos with recent activity if possible)\n   - (3) Core description for each repo (1-2 sentences - what/why important)\n   - (4) 3-5 ideas immediately applicable to OpenClaw or Claude Code (automation/security/dev productivity perspective)\n   - (5) 3 actions to execute today\n3. Duplicate repos only once, concise within 2500 characters\n4. Korean language\n\nCurrent time is Thursday, April 9, 2026 at 7:34 AM Asia/Seoul (2026-04-08 22:34 UTC). The job is scheduled for 09:00 KST, which is in about 26 minutes.\n\nSince this is a cron job, I need to:\n1. Fetch GitHub trending data using GitHub API\n2. Process the data according to the requirements\n3. Generate the briefing in Korean\n4. The cron system will automatically deliver it to Sam\n\nLet me start by fetching the data. I'll use the `gh` CLI or direct GitHub API calls. I'll check what tools I have available - I have `exec` which can run shell commands.\n\nFirst, let me try to use `gh api` to fetch trending repos. GitHub doesn't have a direct trending API endpoint, but I can search for repositories sorted by stars and filter by creation date.\n\n\nI'll craft API queries to capture recent and popular repositories. I'll focus on two key searches: recent repositories created in the last week and highly starred repositories. I'll use `gh api` with precise query parameters to gather the most relevant data for the briefing.\n\nThe searches will target repositories created within the last 7 days for the trending list, and top starred repositories for the overall popular list. I'll limit results to 5 repositories per query to keep the briefing concise and targeted.\n\nI'll execute these API calls directly through the shell to ensure I get the most up-to-date repository information.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"GitHub 인기 레포 브리핑을 생성하기 위해 데이터를 조회하겠습니다."},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_e9de9c3810904e9c809e228e","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"gh api search/repositories -f q=\"created:>$(date -d '7 days ago' +%Y-%m-%d) stars:>10\" -f sort=stars -f order=desc -f per_page=5 --jq '.items[] | {name: .full_name, stars: .stargazers_count, url: .html_url, description: .description, language: .language, created_at: .created_at}'"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"zai","model":"glm-4.7","usage":{"input":13323,"output":1178,"cacheRead":10334,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":24835,"cost":{"input":0.007993799999999999,"output":0.0025916000000000003,"cacheRead":0.00113674,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.011722139999999999}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1775687670602,"responseId":"20260409063431110d2728d584428c"}}
